# CLAUDE.local.md — personal, this repo only

> Rename this file to `CLAUDE.local.md`. It's in `.gitignore`, so it stays on your machine and never reaches teammates.
> Use it for shortcuts that help you in this repo but would be noise for anyone else.

- I preview on my phone: after `npm run dev`, also print the network URL so I can open it there.
- I draft newsletter issues on Sunday nights. If I open an issue file, remind me which events in `site/content/events/` fall in the next 10 days.
- My local checkout has an untracked `scratch/` folder. Ignore it.
